    "en": "<h1>Terms &amp; Disclaimer</h1>\n<p>Effective: 1 November 2026</p>\n<h2>A Moment for Reflection</h2>\n<p>This reading is intended for entertainment and self-reflection. The cards offer perspectives to explore, not promises of what the future holds. Your choices remain your own.</p>\n<h2>What Stillwater is</h2>\n<p>Stillwater is a tarot reading service that helps you explore your situation and look at it from different perspectives, with Vera and the 22-card Stillwater Major Arcana deck.</p>\n<h2>What a reading can and can't do</h2>\n<p>Readings are for entertainment and self-reflection only. They are not medical, psychological, legal, financial, or any other professional advice, and they are not a substitute for it. Please don't make major decisions based only on a reading.</p>\n<h2>How readings are made</h2>\n<p>Vera is the voice of Stillwater. Her readings are produced through Stillwater's system, based on the cards drawn and the card meanings we wrote. They are not live readings by a person. All cards are drawn at random each time.</p>\n<h2>Looking after yourself</h2>\n<p>If you're having thoughts of harming yourself, please reach out to someone you trust or call Thailand's Mental Health Hotline <a href=\"tel:1323\">1323</a> (24 hours), or <a href=\"tel:1669\">1669</a> in an emergency.</p>\n<h2>Payment and what you get</h2>\n<p>You type one question. The site draws 1 free card, with Vera's reading of it on screen.</p>\n<p>If you'd like to go further, you can pay ฿59 by PromptPay QR, a Thailand-based payment method. The price and what you get are shown next to the QR before you pay, along with links to these terms and the Privacy Notice.</p>\n<p>We check your payment from your transfer slip. A slip unlocks a reading only if the amount is exactly ฿59, it was paid to Stillwater's registered account, it is dated after you asked your question, and it hasn't been used before. Each slip can be used only once. Invalid or already-used slips can't unlock a reading.</p>\n<p>Once your payment is confirmed, the site draws 3 new cards, different from your free card, and reads them for the same question:</p>\n<ul><li>Card 1: energy from the past</li><li>Card 2: the present situation</li><li>Card 3: the tendency ahead</li></ul>\n<p>Your reading appears on the same page after the system confirms your payment, usually within a minute. For some banks, slip confirmation can take up to about 10 minutes. While you wait, you can tap to check again. Please don't pay again.</p>\n<p>Your full reading is kept only in your own browser, not on our servers, so we recommend saving it as a file or sharing it, so you can come back to it later. Each reading has a Reading ID shown on screen. Please note it down for when you contact us.</p>\n<h2>Scope of purchase</h2>\n<p>One payment (฿59) unlocks one full 3-card reading for one question. It doesn't include unlimited new questions. A new question starts a new reading.</p>\n<h2>Data and privacy</h2>\n<p>We handle personal data in line with Thailand's Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA). What we collect, why, how long we keep it, and how to use your rights are set out in Stillwater's Privacy Notice. In short, we delete question data within 90 days, except data the law requires us to keep longer, or data tied to a complaint or refund that hasn't been resolved yet.</p>\n<h2>If something goes wrong</h2>\n<p>Sometimes a card draw or reading may not display. If that happens:</p>\n<ul><li><strong>A card can't be drawn, or the free reading fails:</strong> just ask your question again. You won't be charged.</li><li><strong>Payment isn't confirmed yet:</strong> tap to check again. Please don't pay again.</li><li><strong>Paid, but no reading appears:</strong> please don't pay again. Keep your slip, note the time, and contact us. We'll deliver your reading or refund you as set out in &quot;Refunds and problems&quot;.</li><li><strong>Paid twice:</strong> we'll refund the extra payment.</li></ul>\n<h2>Refunds and problems</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>Paid, but no reading appeared or the reading failed:</strong> contact us with your slip or payment reference. We'll deliver your reading or refund the full ฿59. Please let us know as soon as possible (ideally within 7 days) so we can check it easily.</li><li><strong>Paid twice for the same reading:</strong> we'll refund the extra payment.</li><li><strong>Change of mind, or not happy with what the cards say:</strong> this isn't refundable, since the reading is a digital service that was fully delivered as described. But if something went wrong, please tell us.</li></ul>\n<p>Refunds go back by PromptPay or bank transfer within 7 business days after we confirm the refund.</p>\n<p>These terms don't limit your rights as a consumer under the law.</p>\n<h2>Limits of responsibility</h2>\n<p>A reading can't guarantee that someone will come back, that a relationship will work out, or that future events will follow what the cards suggest. Your decisions remain your own responsibility. Our responsibility is to deliver the reading you paid for, as described in these terms.</p>\n<h2>Contact</h2>\n<p>Email: <a href=\"mailto:oneera1991@gmail.com\">oneera1991@gmail.com</a></p>\n<p>To report a payment or reading problem, please include:</p>\n<ul><li>your transfer slip (or payment reference)</li><li>your Reading ID, if you have it</li><li>the time of your payment or reading</li><li>the question you asked</li></ul>"
